    "detailed_description": "<strong>WHAT'S INCLUDED IN MONOTONIA: FIRST CONTACT</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547200/extras/841652330ac5ef4e057f61f714ecfedc.poster.avif?t=1702384232\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547200/extras/841652330ac5ef4e057f61f714ecfedc.webm?t=1702384232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547200/extras/841652330ac5ef4e057f61f714ecfedc.mp4?t=1702384232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In the prologue of MONOTONIA, you will discover the events that precede the main game campaign. Experience the initial work cycles, pay off your debts, and survive in a dark and oppressive work system!<br><br><strong>FEATURES</strong><br><br>With just one button, evade resistances, generate as much energy as possible, and be rewarded based on your performance.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547200/extras/06fa23299dfebfc4a9b614fddca6e6cc.poster.avif?t=1702384232\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547200/extras/06fa23299dfebfc4a9b614fddca6e6cc.webm?t=1702384232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547200/extras/06fa23299dfebfc4a9b614fddca6e6cc.mp4?t=1702384232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Choose one of the available upgrades at the end of each cycle.<br><br>Manage your debts and survive for as long as you can.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547200/extras/f2cc382da88fb5f775063d927d7049ad.poster.avif?t=1702384232\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547200/extras/f2cc382da88fb5f775063d927d7049ad.webm?t=1702384232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547200/extras/f2cc382da88fb5f775063d927d7049ad.mp4?t=1702384232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
